he perfect pizza sauce. From finding the perfect tomatoes to figuring out the perfect cooking method, there is no length that Andy and Brad won't go  to reach perfection.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/16Ht6XYFrkgwqoNX9XGlqzi5wPt.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2019-04-23\",\"runtime\":40},{\"number\":3,\"name\":\"Carla and Molly Try to Make the Perfect Pizza Cheese\",\"overview\":\"It's episode three and this one is all about cheese. The search for cheesy perfection takes Carla and Molly all the way to Italy to learn about how buffalo mozzarella is made.  Can Carla and Molly match Claire's perfect pizza dough and sauce boys Brad and Andy perfect pizza sauce?\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/x3zhMpr98qWeczfZgz04o1FIYxN.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2019-04-23\",\"runtime\":40},{\"number\":4,\"name\":\"Chris and Andy Try to Make the Perfect Pizza Toppings\",\"overview\":\"In episode four, Andy and Chris (and substitute chef Molly) search high and low in New York City for the perfect pizza toppings. Is less more when adding toppings to a pizza? Are there any toppings everybody can agree on?\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/1rnSXmjn15JvPNib7boQr1kmuTc.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2019-04-23\",\"runtime\":40},{\"number\":5,\"name\":\"Brad, Claire, Carla, Molly, Chris & Andy Cook the Perfect Pizza\",\"overview\":\"This is it. The final episode of the season. Brad. Claire. Molly. Andy. Chris. Carla. Did these great minds accomplish the unthinkable and make the perfect pizza? Did they discover the perfect combination of dough, sauce, cheese and toppings and if so will they share their secrets with us? Well, yes they did and yes they will.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xqog6Wtwv0drQ96KQ9tfm559xwf.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2019-04-23\",\"runtime\":40},{\"number\":6,\"name\":\"50 Minutes of Claire, Brad, Chris, Carla, Molly and Andy Talking Pizza\",\"overview\":\"Brad, Claire, Chris, Carla, Molly and Andy weren't always the perfect pizza making geniuses they are now. But then these great minds came together for a singular meeting. No, a symposium! And what did they do? Oh nothing, other than lay the groundwork for what would become the single greatest pie of pizza ever constructed. Now you can can witness that momentous discussion for yourself.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/vz0GksdvHnFs2454KzgONOsU33a.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2019-06-11\",\"runtime\":40}],\"firstAirDate\":\"2019-04-23\"}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}